Subject: [PATCH] fix(access): initialize Chrome profile unit test runtime

Use the Chrome unit-test main for Profile-owning Access tests so
Chrome paths, resources, and Mojo are initialized before fixtures.
Provide a BrowserTaskEnvironment in source-generation fixtures.

---
 3 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/aegis/access/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/aegis/access/BUILD.gn
